WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:01.801
-Good evening.

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:02.834
I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.834 --> 00:00:04.167
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:05.434
Now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:08.133
After the White House
announced last week

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:10.634
that the construction
will resume on the border wall,

00:00:10.634 --> 00:00:12.701
President Biden told reporters,

00:00:12.701 --> 00:00:14.868
"I was told that
I had no choice."

00:00:14.868 --> 00:00:17.367
Oh, man, I have a bad feeling
we're gonna find out

00:00:17.367 --> 00:00:21.200
this was all the work of one
really good telemarketer.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.868
[ As Biden ] They said
if I build a border wall,

00:00:22.868 --> 00:00:24.667
I get three months
of Spectrum Internet.

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:27.267
I had to do it.

00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:28.968
[ Normal voice ]
According to a new analysis,

00:00:28.968 --> 00:00:31.000
over one-third
of Supreme Court decisions

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.200
are decided unanimously.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.968
The other two-thirds are decided

00:00:33.968 --> 00:00:36.801
by whoever took Clarence Thomas
on his last vacation.

00:00:36.801 --> 00:00:38.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.734 --> 00:00:42.400
The IRS last week placed a lien
on a Florida property

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.934
owned by Rudy Giuliani.

00:00:43.934 --> 00:00:45.834
I'm guessing
the Haunted Mansion?

00:00:45.834 --> 00:00:47.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.868 --> 00:00:50.634
[ As Giuliani ] It's all yours.

00:00:50.634 --> 00:00:53.801
Those ghosts won't let me sleep.

00:00:53.801 --> 00:00:55.133
[ Normal voice ]
After leaving the White House,

00:00:55.133 --> 00:00:57.200
former president Trump
reportedly shared details

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:59.501
about the capabilities
of U.S. nuclear submarines

00:00:59.501 --> 00:01:02.300
with an Australian billionaire,
including how close

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:05.267
they can sail to Russian vessels
without being detected.

00:01:05.267 --> 00:01:07.434
Said Trump, "Oh, come on,
I'm not an idiot.

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:09.267
I told Putin first."

00:01:09.267 --> 00:01:11.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.467 --> 00:01:12.901
House Republicans
reportedly held

00:01:12.901 --> 00:01:15.367
a phones-off, closed-door
meeting today

00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:17.067
to discuss the speakership.

00:01:17.067 --> 00:01:18.634
And when they turned
their phones back on,

00:01:18.634 --> 00:01:21.868
Matt Gaetz had
three more Venmo requests.

00:01:21.868 --> 00:01:24.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.834 --> 00:01:26.734
New York governor Kathy Hochul

00:01:26.734 --> 00:01:28.367
ordered
the State Liquor Authority

00:01:28.367 --> 00:01:32.334
to allow bars to serve alcohol
as early as 8:00 a.m. yesterday

00:01:32.334 --> 00:01:35.200
for the Buffalo Bills game
played in London.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:36.968
Not only that,
during the Giants game,

00:01:36.968 --> 00:01:39.667
she temporarily
legalized heroin.

00:01:39.667 --> 00:01:41.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.901 --> 00:01:48.033
The genetic testing company
23andMe announced last week

00:01:48.033 --> 00:01:50.534
that hackers stole personal
data from their database.

00:01:50.534 --> 00:01:52.234
Authorities described
the suspect

00:01:52.234 --> 00:01:56.934
as 62% European and 38%
East Asian and Native American.

00:01:56.934 --> 00:01:58.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.734 --> 00:02:01.167
Georgia is said to become
the first state in the country

00:02:01.167 --> 00:02:03.267
to offer medical marijuana
at pharmacies.

00:02:03.267 --> 00:02:06.501
So you'll finally have a use
for that giant receipt.

00:02:06.501 --> 00:02:10.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.367 --> 00:02:13.167
Burger King has announced
that it will offer a new side

00:02:13.167 --> 00:02:15.634
that is half French fries,
half onion rings.

00:02:15.634 --> 00:02:17.767
Wow, the only way
you could get that before

00:02:17.767 --> 00:02:19.534
was to order onion rings.

00:02:19.534 --> 00:02:21.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.701 --> 00:02:27.701
Best joke of the day.
It's a little bit --

00:02:27.701 --> 00:02:29.033
Still a really good show,

00:02:29.033 --> 00:02:31.234
but it's a little bit downhill
after the onion rings.

00:02:31.234 --> 00:02:34.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.501 --> 00:02:37.000
And finally, Google Cloud today
announced a new

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:40.167
artificial-intelligence-powered
search function for doctors,

00:02:40.167 --> 00:02:42.734
because nothing inspires
confidence in your doctor

00:02:42.734 --> 00:02:46.400
quite like hearing,
"Let's Google it."

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:48.501
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:49.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:49.701 --> 00:02:51.334
We're off and running.

00:02:54.767 --> 00:02:59.434
It is never easy to make
a transition like this.

00:02:59.434 --> 00:03:01.801
But I do want to address --

00:03:01.801 --> 00:03:04.234
I'm sure you all are aware
of the atrocities

00:03:04.234 --> 00:03:06.434
that were committed
against Israel this weekend.

00:03:06.434 --> 00:03:09.267
They were monstrous
and horrific acts of violence.

00:03:09.267 --> 00:03:11.501
I will not pretend
to have any answers

00:03:11.501 --> 00:03:14.300
as to how to respond
to a crisis like this.

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:16.701
I will only say
that in the moments

00:03:16.701 --> 00:03:20.567
when we are confronted
with such evil, inhumane acts,

00:03:20.567 --> 00:03:24.200
we are most at risk
of losing our own humanity.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:29.167
When we are, justifiably,
blind with rage and sadness,

00:03:29.167 --> 00:03:32.133
we can make choices
that will have massive,

00:03:32.133 --> 00:03:35.934
irrevocable impacts on the lives
of our fellow man.

00:03:35.934 --> 00:03:38.868
It requires
the absolute best of us

00:03:38.868 --> 00:03:40.534
to think clearly
in times like this.

00:03:40.534 --> 00:03:41.968
And I hope with all my heart

00:03:41.968 --> 00:03:46.801
the best of us can emerge in
this time of unthinkable loss.

00:03:46.801 --> 00:03:50.467
Thank you, everybody,
for bearing with me to say that.

